==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|it|en}} {{term|tariffa|lang=it}}, from {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|تعاريف|sc=Arab|tr=taʿārif|lang=ar||fees to be paid}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# a [[system]] of [[government]]-[[impose]]d [[duties]] [[levied]] on [[import]]ed or [[export]]ed [[goods]]; a [[list]] of such duties, or the duties themselves
# a [[schedule]] of [[rate]]s, [[fee]]s or [[price]]s
# {{context|British|lang=en}} a [[sentence]] determined according to a [[scale]] of [[standard]] [[penalties]] for certain [[categories]] of [[crime]]

